      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1901-08-09_WidnesExaminer_art0014" n="art0014">
        <head>FRODSHAM ATHLETIC SPORTS.</head>
        <p>FRODSHAM ATHLETIC SPORTS.</p>
        <p>There was s large attendance at the annual sports in connection with the Frodsharn Athletic Club held on Monday on the club's ground. The entries for the various events showed an increase on those of last year, and altogether there was a decided improvement in the competition. The ground was in splendid condition, and very favourably impressed the visitors. The following were the results of the sports. 100 Yards Members' Race.—First heat : 1, J Tomalin, 7 yards ' • 2, T Booth, 3 yards. Second heat 1, A Ashworth, 1 yard; 2, J Clarke. 10 yards ; 3. G Linaker, 1 yard._ Final A Ashworth,2, J Linaker. _ . . _ _ _ .</p>
        <p>100 Yards Flat Race.-First beat: E Sutton,Frodsham, yards; 2, W Oagnall, Widnes, 6 yards ; 3, W Moran, Bootle, 5 yards ; 4, G Williams, Rocksavage, 5 yards ; 5, F Cartwright, Weston, 4 yards ; 6, 8 Hoekenal, Warrington, 6,!-, yards. Final • 1, W Bagnall, Widnes; 2, 8 Hockenal, Warrington ; 3. F Cartwright, Weston. One Mile Flat Race.-Final : 1, VI, l Pearson, Lymm, 80 yards •, 2, W Nield, Ice, 45 yaros ;3, 8 Whitlow Preston Brook, 40 yards. One Mile Bicycle Race.-First heat : 1, J Morrey, Altrincham, 70 yards ; 2, F Walters, Altrincham, 60 yards ; 3, F Plinston' Warrington. 90 yards. Second heat : 1, W Scott, Tarporley, 20 yards ; 2, E Stockton. Ellesmere Port, 75 yards ; 3, L Prince, Warrington, 90 yards. Finsl: 1, W Scott, Tarporley ;2, E Stockton, Ellesmere Port ; 3, F Walters, Altrincham. Scott won easily. Half Mile Flat Race.-Final : 1, L Rutter, North- wlch, SO yards ;2, R Clays, Runcorn, 20 yards ; 3, T Tickle, Preston Brook, 45 yards. Two Miles Bicycle R4OO. First heat: 1, W Scott, Tarporley, 50 yards; 2, E Stockton, Ellesmere Port, 100 yards; 3, A Grimshaw, Warrington 110 yards. Second heat: 1, F Walters, Altrincham, 110 yards ; 1, J Morrey, , Altrincham, 180 yards ;3, 8 H Meadowcroft, Runcorn, 130 yards : Final: 1, W Scott; 2, S H Meadowcroft ;3, J Morrey, Altrincham. 440 Yards Flat Race -1, G Williams, Rocksavage, 15 yards ; 2, W Nield, Ice, 18 yards ; 3 T Tickle, Preston Brook, 20 yards. Second heat : 1, W Darnall, Widnes. 25 yards; 2, W Johnson,Trafford,24 yards; 3,S Whitlow. Preston Brook, 20 yards. Final : 1, W Johnson ;2, W Nield, Ince; 3, B Whitlow. The prizes were af6erwards distributed to the success- ful competitors by Mrs J J Crosfield. During tic- afternoon, the Frodsham Volunteer Band \ diseoursed sweet music, which considerably brightened the pro- cesdings.</p>
