        <p>Two Mile Bicycle : 1, W Scott, Tarp sr- ley, scratch ; 2, T Ridgway, Saltney, scratch ; 3, T Clutron, Wrexham, 80 yards. 100 Yards Sick Race —Final : 1, J f weed's, Helsby. 15 yards; 2, W Barber, Helsby, 10 yards; 3, W Johnson, Trafford, scratch. 440 Yards Flat Race.—First Heat : 1, 9 Whitlow, Preston Brook, 25 yards; 2, M Boyle, Helsby, 25 yards; 3, W H Cartwright, Dunham Bill, 30 yards. Second heat: 1, T Summerfield, WPsron, 28 yards; 2, W Fenton, Helsby. 18 cards; 3, J J Matthews, Runcorn, 20 yards Final: 1, T Summerfield, Weston; 2, G Whitlow, Preston Brook; 3. W Fenton , Helsby. Hill Race (scratch). Challenge Cup (presented by M, ,pnYelsobuyd., HelsbY ; 2, G Bromley, jHaeml s James ; Taylor).-1. oTrw) iTe</p>
