        <p>NEW lievaamows.—List of new inventions supplied by John G Wilson and Co.' Fels Inst P, A, 55 Varkec-st rest Manchester :-14840, ElHaggis, Manchescer, a new or improved guard or cover for use in connection with ironing or calendering machines-; 14848, W Raughton and R Todd, Manchester, an improved fastener for ladies' hats and bonnets ; 14849, W E Bradbury, Man- chester, improvements in holders for floral button holes nosegays, bouquets and the like; 14854, G Schumacher, Manchester, improvements in and relating to stoppers caps and the like for bottles, jars, and similar vessels ; 14936, A Willison. Manchester, the fast screw and drivers; 14945, W Wade, Manches- ter, improvements applicable to kilos or mull s for " hardening-on" or " firing " earthenware 14,946,Mas Haas Manchester, improvements in and con- nected with electrelytie apparatus ; 15,025, H D Earl, Manchester, imorovements to and connected with pneu- matic tyres ; 15,026. H Golland, Manchester, improve- aments in yarn windicik machines; 15,027, J W Shaw and C P Hough, Manchester.improvements in numerical printing Machines ; 15,036, J Gardner, Manchester, improversients in and connected with aerial tele- graphic apparatus ; 15,225, C Fletcher, Manchester, improved method of and apparatus for separating oil and grease from exhaust steam, applicable also as a steam dryer ; 15,237, A A Haigh, Manchester, improved machine for making firelighters and the like ; 15,254, W Harrison, Manchester, trousers braces.</p>
